(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF ELECTRONICS AND INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: PRODUCTION LINKED INCENTIVE SCHEME \(PLI\) FOR LARGE SCALE ELECTRONICS \(PLI-ELECTRONICS\) / IFCI / MEITY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Financial incentive of 4% to 6% on incremental sales \(over base year\) of) Tj
T*
(goods manufactured in India covering mobile phones and specified electronic) Tj
T*
(components.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Companies incorporated in India engaged in domestic manufacturing of) Tj
T*
(   target electronics products.) Tj
T*
(2. Must meet minimum threshold criteria of incremental cumulative) Tj
T*
(   investment in plant & machinery.) Tj
T*
(3. Must achieve minimum incremental sales threshold of manufactured goods) Tj
T*
(   over the base year.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Incentive of 4% to 6% on incremental sales \(over base year\) of goods) Tj
T*
(   manufactured in India for a period of 5 years.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 6.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 50.00 Crore per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Certificate of Incorporation and Memorandum of Association) Tj
T*
(2. Audited Financial Statements and Statutory Auditor's certificate) Tj
T*
(3. Customs / Excise / GST return records proving incremental sales) Tj
T*
(4. Chartered Engineer certificate for plant and machinery investment) Tj
T*
(5. Factory license and industrial approvals) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online through IFCI PLI Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.meity.gov.in/esdm/pli) Tj
T*
ET
